    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "It is interesting that there are some striking similarities between learning a language and learning a musical instrument. Both require daily practice, careful listening, and the courage to make mistakes in front of others. In fact, many teachers say that students who play an instrument often find it easier to hear the rhythm and stress of a new language."
    },
